<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Fixlet>
    <Title>Config - Wake on Lan - Enable - Mac</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>This enables Wake on Lan on a Mac.</P>
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Inventory content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>mac of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance>exists dictionaries whose (not exists integers &quot;Wake On LAN&quot; of it or exists integers &quot;Wake On LAN&quot; whose (it != 1) of it) of values of entries of dictionaries &quot;Custom Profile&quot; of dictionaries of files &quot;/Library/Preferences/SystemConfiguration/com.apple.PowerManagement.plist&quot;</Relevance>
    <Category>BIOS Settings</Category>
    <Source>Internal</Source>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2016-04-29</SourceReleaseDate>
    <MIMEField>
    	<Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
    	<Value>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 20:38:22 +0000</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <DefaultAction ID="Action1">
      <Description>
        <PreLink>Click </PreLink>
        <Link>here</Link>
        <PostLink> to enable Wake On LAN on a Mac.</PostLink>
      </Description>
      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell">wait pmset -a womp 1
</ActionScript>
    </DefaultAction>
  </Fixlet>
</BES>
